{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/6b17cd1bf5beec251f31961ca6bb8dfa.avif?t=1760968506\" width=614 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/012891e988bc210e4f391dbdfda85004.avif?t=1760968506\" width=615 height=105 /></span>In Boba Tea Shop Simulator, you get to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfMake various type of drinks, add different toppings and try your best to satisfy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfManage the time well and add the right amount of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfThe quality of your drinks will affect your score and popularity of your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfMaking drinks can also be satisfying with the in-game audio and hilarious physics you can play around with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.poster.avif?t=1760968506\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.webm?t=1760968506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.mp4?t=1760968506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/7cb1d5ce2a395783bbd379fb561c31eb.avif?t=1760968506\" width=615 height=105 /></span>Being a shop owner isn't easy, you have to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfRestock different types of supplies and consumables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfBoil tea and clean up the mess you made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfFinding your own pace on doing the errands is the key to a successful tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ea95cc642f5a044eaf6b2d638745ad7c.poster.avif?t=1760968506\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ea95cc642f5a044eaf6b2d638745ad7c.webm?t=1760968506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ea95cc642f5a044eaf6b2d638745ad7c.mp4?t=1760968506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/d6d27f71d11b0034b788017f0fad7508.avif?t=1760968506\" width=615 height=105 /></span>     \u25cfSpending on the decorations and furnitures for your tea shop can be a good idea, the customers prefer clean and stylized shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfYou can place the items anywhere you want and create your one and only tea shop in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ee97f3d939c702f814bfefba910e3f3f.poster.avif?t=1760968506\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ee97f3d939c702f814bfefba910e3f3f.webm?t=1760968506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ee97f3d939c702f814bfefba910e3f3f.mp4?t=1760968506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/eeb4f3ffba092778d565db8b0085abd9.avif?t=1760968506\" width=615 height=105 /></span>     \u25cfBy completing different tasks, you can unlock more type of tea and missions, doing tasks can also increase your shop's popularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \u25cfMaking smart choices during tasks can also affect how well your shop is going to do in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/3dc0d05463f25d8d25aaa1bd70e78df6.poster.avif?t=1760968506\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/3dc0d05463f25d8d25aaa1bd70e78df6.webm?t=1760968506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/3dc0d05463f25d8d25aaa1bd70e78df6.mp4?t=1760968506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2189450?t=1760968506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2189450?t=1760968506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/cc5c0fd653638baaed8a67148ba705f28746bbdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760968506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/cc5c0fd653638baaed8a67148ba705f28746bbdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760968506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2346910,"descripti